le  decision that hasn't been thought  through or joined up and you know that's  not particularly reassuring uh to be  trying to to put a comment on i mean i  understand the good the intel the  intents and the purposes of this are  trying to make sure that more people get  vaccinated but that messaging i'm afraid  it's all it's all over the shop here and  jasmine the the metro uh suggesting that  vaccine passports are on their way  according to nadine harvey again  so it's quite an interesting one because  when the notion of vaccine passports was  floated early in the summer it was in  the context of the government being  worried about uptake among the young  particularly the under 30s and there was  this hint that you know maybe it was  just deployed to get the young people to  take the jab but the government seemed  to really sticking to this issue in  spite of you know the inevitable  backbench pushback that they're going to  receive from this and the argument from  the vaccine minister is that actually it  makes business sense they need to find a  way in which businesses especially night  clubs and sort of entertainment venues  or places where you know lots of people  gather need to find ways of making sure  that these businesses can operate in a  covered secure way and so it does seem  to make logical sense on the surface but  i think there are lots of questions  about how this is going to be  practically enforced whether it's a case  of people who need to show  proof of having a jab or whether they  need to show proof of a negative test or  both and so there are lots of questions  surrounding this and it's also unclear  as to how far this policy will actually  extend so the focus at the moment is on  night clubs but you know could it be  sporting venues it seems to be a little  bit vague at the moment and i think the  government are really going to need to  outline some details to the public and  to back ventures and to businesses to  make it clear how this policy can be  implemented on a practical day-to-day  basis

